OL,5,G0435 Discovering: Jimi Hendrix
OL,6,     FMusic experts discuss the life and
OL,7,     Fmusic of Jimi Hendrix, who wowed
OL,8,     Faudiences in the 1960s with his
OL,9,     Foutrageous electric guitar playing
OL,10,     Fskills and his experimental sound.
OL,11,     F(S5, ep 6)
OL,12,G0500 Lou Reed: Classic Albums
